Package: util-linux
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: util-linux-bash-completion
Description: Linux system management utilities
 Command-line tools, including optional static variants.

Package: util-linux-login
Architecture: amd64
Provides: login
Static-Built-Using: sqlite (= 3.54.1)
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: System login and login accounting utilities
 Login, account information, login history and session accounting tools.

