Package: util-linux-disk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Disk and filesystem management utilities
 Tools for partitioning, creating, checking and maintaining filesystems and block devices.

Package: util-linux-su
Architecture: amd64
Provides: su
Static-Built-Using: libxcrypt (= 1:4.4.38-1)
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: User switching and emergency login utilities
 su, runuser and sulogin for user switching and emergency system login.

Package: util-linux-mount
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Mount and unmount utilities
