Package: util-linux-log
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kernel logging and terminal session recording utilities
 Tools for reading kernel messages, sending syslog messages and recording or replaying terminal sessions.

Package: util-linux-bash-completion
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Bash completion for util-linux commands
